0..61 Comment "// The circle as a group under rotation, after cubical Agda\'s"
62..137 Comment "// `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda` and `S1/Properties.agda`: the multiplication"
138..216 Comment "// that rotates by the loop and its four inverse laws, every point\'s loop told"
217..287 Comment "// apart from every point\'s reflexivity as functions, and the circle\'s"
288..349 Comment "// universal property, maps out of it as a point with a loop."
350..423 Comment "// `circle-group.gandr` holds the loop space\'s group laws. A row the tree"
424..497 Comment "// refuses today states the refusal it meets and the issue that holds it."
498..500 Comment "//"
501..577 Comment "// Out of reach by design: `rotIsEquiv` needs equivalences as structure, and"
578..631 Comment "// `invS¹Equiv` and `invS¹Path` univalence as well."
